Ouch.  I'd say to write a new one, but you say that you don't
have any more markers...

> I am invisible and displaced - but I still end up getting hit
> with amnesia.

Being invisible negates displaced.  Are you MC 3?

> Unless I YASD, I am surely bound for ascension.  But I am
> worried that I will have a very frustrating time with amnesia.
> Who has suggestions?  Perhaps if I boost my AC down to -50
> they will miss me?

Amnesia isn't *that* bad except in certain cases (as you
found out).  The relative lack of real mazes in Lethe means
that  remapping everything isn't as tedious.  Just make sure
to have stashes at every reasonable point (and there are a
few extra altars/temples in Lethe to make it a bit easier).

By the way, I assume you know that high dexterity gives you
extra AC, so that gauntles of dexterity are worth roughly
double the plusses?

